# SQLite cache: committed on purpose as a pre-seeded, read-only snapshot of a
# completed season. Production (Render) serves it with OFFLINE_CACHE=1 and never
# calls stats.nba.com (which blocks datacenter IPs). Re-seed with seed_cache.py
# and commit the refreshed file when you change SEASON. (Not ignored.)

